*VERSION 15000000
!
! Synthetic fixture. The DRAWING order below is deliberately not the part file's
! pad order: pin 2 is DELTA on pad 4, where an ordinal join would say BETA on pad 2.
!
*UNITS 1000.000000 per_inch
*CELL_OPEN GIZMO4 0
*GFX_LINE 0 0.005in 3 0 <300,200> <1500,200>
*GFX_LINE 0 0.005in 3 0 <1500,200> <1500,-800>
*GFX_LINE 0 0.005in 3 0 <1500,-800> <300,-800>
*GFX_LINE 0 0.005in 3 0 <300,-800> <300,200>
*PIN 1 11 <0,0>
*PIN 2 11 <0,-100>
*PIN 3 11 <0,-300>
*PIN 4 11 <1800,-300>
*PIN 5 11 <1800,0>
*TEXT 0.082in 0 3 -1 0 1 1 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <310,0> 1 0 "ALPHA"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 4 1 -1 1 1 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <100,0> 1 0 "1"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 3 -1 0 1 2 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <310,-100> 1 0 "DELTA"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 4 1 -1 1 2 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <100,-100> 1 0 "4"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 3 -1 0 1 3 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <310,-300> 1 0 "BETA"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 4 1 -1 1 3 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <100,-300> 1 0 "2"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 3 1 0 1 4 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <1490,-300> 1 0 "GAMMA"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 4 -1 -1 1 4 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <1300,-300> 1 0 "3"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 3 1 0 1 5 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <1490,0> 1 0 "THERMAL"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 4 -1 -1 1 5 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <1300,0> 1 0 "TPAD"
*TEXT 0.082in 0 7 0 0 1 0 6 "DEFAULT" 0 <900,400> 1 0 "Ref Des"
*CELL_CLOSE <0,0>
